# Only what the build needs goes into the hosted app's images.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.claude
# Secrets never enter an image: the hosted app gets them from .env.prod at runtime.
.env*
!.env.example
backups
apps/server/eval/results
apps/server/eval/private
